  "solution_ref": "$\\{f-1\\}\\{f+x\\}\\{f-x\\}=0$. $f(0)=1$이면 $f\\equiv1$ (최솟값 0 불가). $f(0)=0$ → $f(x)=|x|$ ($|x|\\le1$), $1$ ($|x|>1$). $1+0+\\frac12=\\frac32$",
